    <!-- Terms & Conditions -->
    <string name="terms_document_label">PITWALL · LEGAL</string>
    <string name="terms_effective_date">Effective September 25, 2026 · Please read before using PitWall.</string>
    <string name="terms_intro">By accessing or using PitWall, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, stop using the app. These terms apply alongside the Privacy Policy and any applicable third-party service terms.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_1_title">1. About PitWall</string>
    <string name="terms_section_1_body">PitWall is an independent motorsport companion app for informational and entertainment purposes. It is not an official Formula 1, FIA, team, driver, or race timing service and is not affiliated with or endorsed by them. Names, marks, images, and other third-party materials remain the property of their respective owners.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_2_title">2. Acceptable use</string>
    <string name="terms_section_2_body">Use the app lawfully and in a way that does not disrupt the app, its services, or other users. Do not attempt to gain unauthorized access, interfere with service operation, misuse account features, or use the app to distribute unlawful or harmful content.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_3_title">3. Information and availability</string>
    <string name="terms_section_3_body">Schedules, standings, results, news, radio links, and other motorsport information may come from third-party sources. We aim to present useful information, but it may be delayed, incomplete, or inaccurate and can change without notice. Do not rely on PitWall for official results, time-critical decisions, or safety-related information. Features and availability may change, and services may be interrupted for maintenance or circumstances outside our control.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_4_title">4. Apex AI</string>
    <string name="terms_section_4_body">Apex uses generative AI. Its responses can be incorrect, incomplete, or out of date and are provided for general information only. Verify important claims with reliable sources. Do not treat AI responses as professional advice or as official team, FIA, or race-control guidance.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_5_title">5. Accounts and device features</string>
    <string name="terms_section_5_body">Some features may use sign-in and third-party services. You are responsible for keeping your sign-in credentials secure and for activity on your account. Optional features such as notifications and calendar sync depend on device permissions and settings; you can manage those permissions in Android settings.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_6_title">6. Third-party services and content</string>
    <string name="terms_section_6_body">PitWall may link to or rely on services, APIs, media, and websites operated by others. Those services are provided by their respective operators and may have separate terms and privacy practices. PitWall does not control their availability or content.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_7_title">7. Intellectual property</string>
    <string name="terms_section_7_body">The PitWall app and its original content are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may use the app for personal, non-commercial purposes. Do not copy, modify, redistribute, or commercially exploit app content except where applicable law or a separate license permits it. Third-party content remains subject to its owners’ rights and terms.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_8_title">8. Disclaimers and liability</string>
    <string name="terms_section_8_body">To the extent permitted by applicable law, the app and its information are provided as available, without guarantees of uninterrupted service, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose. To the extent permitted by law, PitWall and its developer are not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from use of, or inability to use, the app. Nothing in these terms limits rights or liability that cannot lawfully be limited.</string>
    <string name="terms_section_9_title">9. Changes and contact</string>
    <string name="terms_section_9_body">These terms may be updated as the app changes. The current version is shown in the app; continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms to the extent permitted by law. For questions, contact support.pitwall@gmail.com.</string>
